USE estimate-template.flow
USE estimate-draft-rules.flow

DO Create and verify a fresh estimate.md from @estimate_template under
    @draft_rules. Use the project and any ticket from @request or known task
    context; no ticket lookup is required. Leave template values empty.
    Return the absolute path. AS draft_path

DO Open @draft_path in the host editor or preview when available.

PRINT "Empty estimate template:" @draft_path
